# Hexa Dark: Breeze Dark's colors (plasma-breeze 6.8.2), under Breeze's
# copyright and license above, with Hexa's yellow accent (242,179,61) in
# place of Breeze's blue: dark text on selections, and accent text in a
# shade readable on the background.

